# The actions' half of the check that an action leads where its key leads (scripts\verify\panel.ps1, part actions):
# the state tests\window-actions-keys.input reaches by keys, reached by actions (src\viewer_actions.ixx), live in a
# window:
#   RayTracingViewer cornell -w 320 --height 180 -s 32 --input tests\window-actions.input --record r.txt
# See that file for what is compared. Each action names where the keys' steps led.
at 20 action sampling material
at 40 action tonemap agx
at 60 action exposure 1
at 80 action scene light
# refused, as F2 is: agx computes in float32 only
at 100 action precision double
at 120 action samples 128
at 160 action defocus-angle 0.25
at 180 action reset-view
at 200 action vfov 18
at 220 action pause on
at 230 action pause off
at 300 action save
at 320 quit
